[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15781.189, "timestamp": "04:23:01", "text": "我不认为这是噪音投诉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15782.349, "timestamp": "04:23:02", "text": "会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15786.389, "timestamp": "04:23:06", "text": "尤其是在宿舍里，要尽可能地像你一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15791.03, "timestamp": "04:23:11", "text": "房间没问题。我希望如此。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15795.87, "timestamp": "04:23:15", "text": "基本上就是“好吧，呃，如果”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15799.189, "timestamp": "04:23:19", "text": "如果你在宿舍里，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15801.91, "timestamp": "04:23:21", "text": "你大概不会有事的。你可以去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15804.87, "timestamp": "04:23:24", "text": "去漫画咖啡馆或网吧，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15808.229, "timestamp": "04:23:28", "text": "别指望那里会很安静。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15811.75, "timestamp": "04:23:31", "text": "差不多。也正是这一点。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15814.149, "timestamp": "04:23:34", "text": "不知道哪里可以租到人声乐器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15816.87, "timestamp": "04:23:36", "text": "隔音间或类似隔音室"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15820.469, "timestamp": "04:23:40", "text": "空间。哦，那里有类似办公室之类的地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15824.95, "timestamp": "04:23:44", "text": "就像胶囊一样，有些地方就像我一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15828.229, "timestamp": "04:23:48", "text": "我从未真正见过他们，但他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15837.59, "timestamp": "04:23:57", "text": "还有什么呢？比如……"}]